.TH LINUX-WEBAUTHN 1 "August 2026" "linux-webauthn 0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
linux-webauthn \- Linux-native WebAuthn/FIDO2 authenticator bridge
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B linux-webauthn
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B linux-webauthn
runs the Linux WebAuthn authenticator as a user-session service. It exposes
an org.linux.WebAuthn D-Bus interface and a virtual FIDO HID authenticator.
Fingerprint user verification and TPM-backed credential handling are
performed by the existing Linux authentication stack.
.PP
The packaged service is intended to run as the logged-in user and does not
require the authenticator daemon to run as root.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR systemctl (1),
.BR busctl (1),
.BR fprintd (1)
.SH AUTHOR
GenXinvenits
